      "refersTo": "language-link",
      "description": "Active edition pair; source links preserve chapter identity.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-language\" aria-label=\"Ngôn ngữ\"><a class=\"ds-focus\" href=\"/vi\" lang=\"vi\" aria-current=\"page\">VI</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"ds-focus\" href=\"/en\" lang=\"en\">EN</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-language{font-family:\"Be Vietnam Pro\",sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--reader-fg,#302b23);font-size:12px;font-weight:500}.ds-language a{padding:9px 8px;min-width:34px;text-align:center;border-radius:4px;opacity:.6;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ds-language a[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--reader-accent,#8d342b) 9%,transparent);color:var(--reader-accent,#8d342b);opacity:1}.ds-language>span{height:14px;border-left:1px solid currentColor;opacity:.2}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-language a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:40px;min-height:40px}}.ds-focus:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--reader-accent,#8d342b);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){button{transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Segmented Control",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "segment",
      "description": "Tinted group with filled selected segment.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-segments\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Chế độ đọc\"><button class=\"ds-focus ds-selected\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Cuộn</button><button class=\"ds-focus\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Một trang</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-segments{font-family:\"Be Vietnam Pro\",sans-serif;display:flex;gap:3px;padding:3px;background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 7%,transparent);border-radius:8px;color:var(--reader-fg,#302b23)}.ds-segments button{font-family:\"Be Vietnam Pro\",sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:1;gap:6px;min-height:34px;border:0;background:transparent;border-radius:5px;font-size:11px;padding:6px 8px;white-space:nowrap;color:inherit;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,color .15s}.ds-segments button:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 8%,transparent)}.ds-segments button.ds-selected{background:var(--reader-accent,#8d342b);color:var(--button-ink,#fffaf0)}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-segments button{min-width:40px;min-height:40px}}.ds-focus:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--reader-accent,#8d342b);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){button{transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reader Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "reader-panel",
      "description": "Scrollable tinted overlay; preview stays in flow, while source is fixed below toolbar.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\" aria-label=\"Cài đặt trình đọc\"><header class=\"ds-panel-heading\"><h2>Cài đặt trình đọc</h2><button class=\"ds-close ds-focus\" aria-label=\"Đóng\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 6-12 12M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button></header><p>Màu sắc và kiểu chữ</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:\"Be Vietnam Pro\",sans-serif;width:min(425px,calc(100vw - 24px));max-height:calc(100dvh - 90px);overflow:auto;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--reader-bg,#f5f0e5) 96%,var(--reader-fg,#302b23));color:var(--reader-fg,#302b23);padding:16px 20px 22px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 14px 50px #0003}.ds-panel-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:15px}.ds-panel h2{font-family:\"Be Vietnam Pro\",sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0}.ds-panel p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}.ds-close{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:38px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer}.ds-close:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 8%,transparent)}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-panel{max-height:calc(100dvh - 110px);padding:16px 18px}.ds-close{width:40px;height:40px}}.ds-focus:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--reader-accent,#8d342b);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){button{transition:none!important}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "An annotated reading edition",
    "overview": "The visitor comes to read an old Vietnamese work on a modern screen, in daylight or evening lamplight. Warm ivory paper, brown ink, vermilion controls, restrained rules, and generous margins carry the approved antique-book world. The supplied blue book cover remains the central visual artifact; its blue is image content rather than a new interface accent.\n\nLiterata gives the title and text their literary character; Be Vietnam Pro keeps controls compact and legible. Novel-Hub's familiar reading structure informs the collapsible contents rail and control bar. The edition is public, bilingual, and readable without an account; sign-in belongs to editors.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Ivory paper, brown ink, and restrained vermilion.",
      "Supplied blue cover; no synthetic replacement imagery.",
      "Literata for reading and display; Be Vietnam Pro for controls.",
      "Ruled contents, adjustable reading width, and a quiet reading column."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Paper and Ink Rule",
        "body": "Reader surfaces, text, rules, and controls follow the active reader palette. Preserve the separate book-page dark palette.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Title Then Author Rule",
        "body": "Keep the author immediately below the book title in normal letter spacing. Do not turn it into an eyebrow or tracked kicker.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Surface Rule",
        "body": "Keep the reading page flat. Reserve shadows for the physical cover and temporary overlays.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve the supplied cover and the approved ivory, brown, and vermilion world.",
      "Do place the author below the book title with normal letter spacing.",
      "Do preserve the two-row phone toolbar, grouped VI/EN control, and 40px minimum targets in the covered phone controls.",
      "Do keep settings scrollable, keyboard focus visible, and reduced-motion handling intact.",
      "Do let chosen reader typography and colors govern the text; distinguish defaults from preferences.",
      "Do re-extract values when code changes and check the final applicable media rule."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't introduce synthetic cover art or promote cover blue into a new interface palette.",
      "Don't add decorative eyebrows, tracked author labels, or extra display faces.",
      "Don't shrink reading text to fit a viewport or screenshot.",
      "Don't claim a paper-fade animation that the code does not implement.",
      "Don't infer hosted authentication, storage, or publishing verification from the locked admin screen."
    ]
  }
}
